どんな時も前を向いて歌っていたい ほら凹んで泣いて辛い時も 強がってるけど平気だよ
No matter what, I want to keep facing forward and singing. Even when I'm feeling down, crying, and struggling, and putting up a brave front saying I'm fine,

256
00:39:08,142 --> 00:39:14,642
きっと君のためならできること 涙も大嫌いにばらまいて 弱くたって虹は呼び出せるよ
I know I can do it for your sake. Scattering my tears away even though I hate them, even if I'm weak, I can summon a rainbow!

257
