It's truly no exaggeration to say that you guys are the ones who made this outfit.

310
00:45:42,311 --> 00:45:45,091
え、ゆっくり見せてもいいかな？ いい？
Um, is it okay if I show you slowly? Is that okay?

311
00:45:45,091 --> 00:45:49,371
こだわりポイントー、いい？ ちょっとだけ、いいかな？
